{
  "schema_version": "1.0.0",
  "edition_id": "ASV1901",
  "book_code": "PSA",
  "chapter": 34,
  "verses": [
    {
      "id": "PSA.34.1",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.34.1",
      "verse": 1,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "I will bless Jehovah at all times:\nHis praise shall continually be in my mouth.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.34.2",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.34.2",
      "verse": 2,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "My soul shall make her boast in Jehovah:\nThe meek shall hear thereof, and be glad.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.34.3",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.34.3",
      "verse": 3,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Oh magnify Jehovah with me,\nAnd let us exalt his name together.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.34.4",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.34.4",
      "verse": 4,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "I sought Jehovah, and he answered me,\nAnd delivered me from all my fears.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.34.5",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.34.5",
      "verse": 5,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "They looked unto him, and were radiant;\nAnd their faces shall never be confounded.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.34.6",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.34.6",
      "verse": 6,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "This poor man cried, and Jehovah heard him,\nAnd saved him out of all his troubles.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.34.7",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.34.7",
      "verse": 7,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The angel of Jehovah encampeth round about them that fear him,\nAnd delivereth them.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.34.8",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.34.8",
      "verse": 8,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Oh taste and see that Jehovah is good:\nBlessed is the man that taketh refuge in him.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.34.9",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.34.9",
      "verse": 9,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Oh fear Jehovah, ye his saints;\nFor there is no want to them that fear him.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.34.10",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.34.10",
      "verse": 10,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The young lions do lack, and suffer hunger;\nBut they that seek Jehovah shall not want any good thing.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.34.11",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.34.11",
      "verse": 11,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Come, ye children, hearken unto me:\nI will teach you the fear of Jehovah.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.34.12",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.34.12",
      "verse": 12,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "What man is he that desireth life,\nAnd loveth ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "many",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " days, that he may see good?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.34.13",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.34.13",
      "verse": 13,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Keep thy tongue from evil,\nAnd thy lips from speaking guile.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.34.14",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.34.14",
      "verse": 14,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Depart from evil, and do good;\nSeek peace, and pursue it.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.34.15",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.34.15",
      "verse": 15,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The eyes of Jehovah are toward the righteous,\nAnd his ears are ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "open",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " unto their cry.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.34.16",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.34.16",
      "verse": 16,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The face of Jehovah is against them that do evil,\nTo cut off the remembrance of them from the earth.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.34.17",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.34.17",
      "verse": 17,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The righteous",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " cried, and Jehovah heard,\nAnd delivered them out of all their troubles.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.34.18",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.34.18",
      "verse": 18,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Jehovah is nigh unto them that are of a broken heart,\nAnd saveth such as are of a contrite spirit.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.34.19",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.34.19",
      "verse": 19,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Many are the afflictions of the righteous;\nBut Jehovah delivereth him out of them all.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.34.20",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.34.20",
      "verse": 20,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He keepeth all his bones:\nNot one of them is broken.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.34.21",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.34.21",
      "verse": 21,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Evil shall slay the wicked;\nAnd they that hate the righteous shall be condemned.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.34.22",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.34.22",
      "verse": 22,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Jehovah redeemeth the soul of his servants;\nAnd none of them that take refuge in him shall be condemned.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    }
  ],
  "headings": [
    {
      "style": "s1",
      "text": "Jehovah a provider and deliverer.",
      "before_verse": 1
    },
    {
      "style": "d",
      "text": "A Psalm of David; See 1 Sam. 21:10–15.when he Or, feigned madnesschanged his behavior before Abimelech, who drove him away, and he departed.",
      "before_verse": 1
    }
  ]
}
